         <title><![CDATA[White House press secretary Katie Zacharia leaving her role a week after starting it: official]]></title>
         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/trump-zacharia-press-secretary-future-9.7383948?cmp=rss</link>
         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/f0e396a4-9e65-4a09-9d03-990846dfc5fc,1792182633490/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C260%2C4988%2C2805%29%3B' alt='Image of a woman in sunglass and with longhair walking on an airplane hangar' width='620' height='349' title='White House press secretary Katie Zacharia arrives with President Donald Trump at Glacier Park International Airport, Wednesday, Oct. 14, 2026, in Kalispell, Mont. (AP Photo/Alex Brandon)'/><p>U.S. President Donald Trump's press secretary Katie Zacharia is leaving her role a mere week after he put her in it, a White House official confirmed to CBC News.</p>]]></description>
