<item>
         <title><![CDATA[Israeli settlers attack Palestinians, American journalist during West Bank olive harvest]]></title>
         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/israeli-settlers-attack-olive-harvest-9.7383174?cmp=rss</link>
         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/7e160bda-0b47-4448-b2ff-01c492ccdf48,1792157595741/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C311%2C4432%2C2493%29%3B' alt='Masked Israeli settlers stand next to a fire burning in an olive grove.' width='620' height='349' title='Israeli settlers next to a fire amid clashes with Palestinians during olive harvest in Abu Falah near Ramallah in the Israeli-occupied West Bank, October 16, 2026. REUTERS/Ammar Awad'/><p>Dozens of masked Israeli settlers attacked Palestinians and injured an American journalist during olive harvesting in the occupied West Bank, according to witnesses and video footage. The Israeli army says the incident "will be examined."</p>]]></description>
         <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:34:39 EDT</pubDate>
