      </item>
<item>
         <title><![CDATA[Man who stopped Oregon elementary school shooter is father of 2 students, his mom says]]></title>
         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/oregon-school-shooting-bystander-9.7384075?cmp=rss</link>
         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/07aa3582-0288-466a-b0c1-65d4e7de246c,1792177450476/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C266%2C4200%2C2362%29%3B' alt='Two people embrace while looking at a memorial.' width='620' height='349' title='Kyle Ketchum, right, embraces Christina Edwards at a makeshift memorial outside Silver Rail Elementary in Bend, Ore., on Friday, a day after the deadly shooting. (AP Photo/Joe Kline)'/><p>The man who stopped a deadly elementary school attack in Oregon by shooting the teenage gunman inside the building is the father of two girls at the school, his mother said Friday.</p>]]></description>
